  "title": "TPG-Led Investor Group Acquires Grocery-Anchored Retail Leader ECHO Realty",
  "summary": "Investments from PSP Investments, La Caisse, and Norges Bank Investment Management will support TPG’s acquisition and future platform growth PITTSBURGH, PA. – TPG Real Estate (“TPG”) today announced the acquisition of ECHO Realty (“ECHO”), a full-service owner and operator of best-in-class grocery-anchored retail real estate, in a transaction valued at approximately $2 billion. The transaction […]",
